<title>JAPAN: Dlr rises to 1.7470 marks, highest since Feb 94.</title>
<headline>Dlr rises to 1.7470 marks, highest since Feb 94.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar advanced sharply against the mark in early afternoon Tokyo trade on Tuesday, rising to 1.7470 marks, its highest level since February 1994, bankers said.</p>
